      "why": "Registering every m stages (m=2-4) reduces FF count versus fully pipelined while maintaining 1 result/cycle throughput. Latency is ceil(N/m)+2 cycles, which for N=12-18 and m=2-4 gives 5-11 cycles, even shorter than fully pipelined. This family may offer a better area/latency trade-off and could dominate pipelined on luts_plus_ffs."
    }
